{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40003","label":"Miracle Snow"},"label":"Santa for a Day: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_miraclesnow1_prologue","next":"event_miraclesnow1_01_e","speakers":{"rupee":"Rupee"},"icons":{"rupee":"si_c200_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_1","text":"Helloooo Lupins! Can you guess where I am?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Winter_AmusementPark","bgArt":"winter_amusementpark","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_shopperholic","movie":null,"shown":["rupee"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_2","text":"The Amusement Park at the Outpost!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_3","text":"Notice anything special? It's snowing!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_4","text":"It's been decided this is the only place where we'll have snow this year.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_5","text":"You know me, I'd never miss a chance to see the snow! So, here I am.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_6","text":"You know what? It has been 15 years since it has last snowed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_7","text":"I'm not too sure about the specifics, but making snow seems to use quite a lot of water!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_8","text":"That's why it's restricted to such a small area. There isn't a suitable spot in the Ark, either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_9","text":"But it's better than nothing. At the very least, we'll have a white Christmas this year!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_10","text":"Not only that, but all the rides are fully functional again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_11","text":"It's all thanks to a certain someone that we all know and love...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_12","text":"And so, the special guest I've invited today is...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_13","text":"The master of the Outpost! The Commander!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_14","text":"{AccountData.NickName}, Sweetie!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_15","text":"Why don't you say hi to our Lupins, Sweetie?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_16","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_16","text":"Hi, everyone.","jump":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_18","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_17","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_17","text":"Wassup, y'all! Commander in the hoouuuuusee!","jump":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_20","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_18","text":"C'mon, you gotta liven it up a little...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_19","text":"... Ya know, engage with the audience.","jump":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_23","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_20","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_21","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_22","text":"All righty, then.","jump":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_23","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_23","text":"Today, we've got a special treat for you all. We've prepared a special White Christmas stream!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_24","text":"What exactly will we be doing for this special occasion, you might ask?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_25","text":"Why, I'm going to be Santa Claus for a day!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_26","text":"Sweetie and I are gonna go around the amusement park and interview anyone we come across.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_27","text":"They'll have to answer the questions they draw randomly from this bag!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_28","text":"Anyone who gives us an interesting answer will get a prize!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_29","text":"We've prepared mystery prizes ranging from R Class to SSSSR Class!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_miraclesnow1_01_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_miraclesnow1_01_s_30","text":"Shall we get started, Sweetie?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}